 Full path to the Launcher executable name.
 Default is (installation prefix)/xmtoolbox
 .TP
+\fBlockCommand\fP \fIString\fP
+Command line of an external screen locker, e.g.
+\fI/usr/bin/xlock \-mode blank\fP or
+\fI/usr/bin/xscreensaver\-command \-lock\fP\.
+The executable must be given with its full path\.
+If set, it is run instead of the built\-in locker whenever the screen is
+locked, and xmsm needs no root privileges for locking\.
+Default is unset (built\-in locker)\.
+.TP
 \fBlockBackgroundColor\fP \fIColor\fP
 Background color of the screen lock.
 .TP
